Emails the work-order PDF to the given address via Resend.
body: { to?: str, subject?: str, message?: str }
Falls back gracefully with `sent=False, reason='resend-not-configured'` if RESEND_API_KEY absent.

AI-powered dosing recommendation.
body: { volume_gal: float, readings: { fc, ph, ta, cya, salt? } }
Returns { recommendations: [{chemical, amount_oz, reason}], warnings: [...] }.

Public — RingCentral posts here. Signature check skipped when unconfigured.

